## 4. Notes
- checkEnglish (≥12 words, Latin-only, ≥3 English stopwords) fires on Dutch sentences that pile
  up "in / is / of / was". Two of my rewrites tripped it (011 L23, 018 L68) and one pre-existing
  line did after the domicileregister fix (017 L55); all three were rephrased, not reverted.
- The disclosure-parity test pins the nl regex /werkbare/ for "feasible-method-only". My first
  wording ("een werkbaar communicatiekanaal") broke it; changed to "een werkbare manier van
  communiceren" rather than editing the test.
- No `[변호사 검수 필요]` markers, no Hangul outside `url:` values, no frontmatter key / url /
  lastmod / featured_image / image path / external link / block-count changes.

